{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a46348cb3be161eb","name":"Triple Attack","source":{"id":"source:reference-a46348cb3be161eb","title":"Triple Attack","revision":24947,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T15:56:57Z","sha256":"5ce20ed4a039d0b72ecf4c0dec05c763b7ad72c43afacc850b86458a4fd878dc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24947","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Triple%20Attack&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a46348cb3be161eb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can make an additional attack during a round of combat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +11, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," (Chosen Weapon)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Choose a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},". When you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action, you may make one additional attack when wielding such a weapon. However, you take a -5 penalty on all attack rolls until your next turn because you're trading precision for speed. The extra attack and penalty stack with those of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},". If you take this feat with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},", it works normally with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," Making a single attack is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You may select this feat multiple times. Each time you select this feat, it applies to a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Multiple Attacks with Multiple Targets"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Can you use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," or Triple Attack to attack the same target multiple times in the same round, or do you have to attack different targets?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," The extra attacks from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},", Triple Attack, and fighting with multiple weapons can be directed at the same target or at different targets, in any combination and any order that you choose.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Double and Rapid Attacks"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," It is possible to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Strike","referenceId":"reference:700a0453398913da"},"?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Yes. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Strike","referenceId":"reference:700a0453398913da"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst_Fire","referenceId":"reference:ff3da4756d0ccd5c"}," all can be used when making multiple attacks, regardless of their source (",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},", Triple Attack, or fighting with multiple weapons).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
